      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHARE THE MUSIC (2) impressed when he dead-heated with Ziggy Bama on debut over 1000m at Ballarat Synthetic a month ago. Has since been kept ticking over with an Ararat trial, better suited this trip and a positive is that Ziggy Bama has since won again out of maiden grade. ARABELLA STAR (3) returned from a spell 3.5 weeks ago when she was beaten 3.5 lengths into seventh over 1000m at Sandown-Hillside. Ideally placed back to this grade and is sure to prove tough to beat. HELLUVA BARTY (1) has been racing consistently this prep and should be around the mark again. EDGES DIAMOND (4) hasn't got warm in two runs this campaign, but they have been in better races than this and he's drawn to run a much-improved race. I'M SAVVY AS (6) was out of the money when resuming two runs back then again missed the frame last start when he was never in contention over 1006m at Sale. Perfectly placed and is sure to take plenty of stopping.",
